<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 361)</h2>
<p><b>Web reviewers see clips arriving, not silence.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>While a share uploads, the web clip list now shows every clip that's coming: dimmed rows with live progress ("encoding…", "preparing… 3/8") that turn into real, playable rows the moment each clip lands. A six-clip share no longer looks like nothing is happening.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
